{"5007300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dynambrinth", "steam_appid": 5007300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5007350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynambrynth</strong> is a stylized, low‑poly dungeon crawler built around tactical combat, deliberate decision‑making, and dynamically generated labyrinths. At the start of each run, a new maze is created—its rooms, paths, and encounters arranged into a fresh layout for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class — <strong>Warrior</strong>, <strong>Mage</strong>, or <strong>Archer</strong> — and master their distinct combat styles. Every strike, spell, and shot matters as you navigate tight corridors, dodge traps, and battle creatures lurking in the depths. Combat rewards timing, positioning, and awareness rather than frantic button‑mashing, creating a clean and readable action experience that feels both accessible and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore handcrafted and procedurally‑generated rooms, uncover secrets, and push deeper into the heart of the maze. Each run offers a new configuration of challenges, but the labyrinth itself remains stable until you fall—or choose to dive back in for another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the maze—if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield Elemental Magic as a Mage:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007300/extras/33b8c18cee87b567c521e3c3f7cbdc88.avif?t=1787421108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007300/extras_big/33b8c18cee87b567c521e3c3f7cbdc88.avif?t=1787421108 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage up close with a Fighter:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_